      "id": "waypoint-ar",
      "title": "Waypoint AR",
      "platform": "AR",
      "summary": "An indoor wayfinding overlay for large venues, using ARKit's scene geometry and LiDAR to occlude routes correctly behind real furniture and walls.",
      "longDescription": "Waypoint AR overlays a walking path on top of the real world inside airports and convention centers. It uses ARKit's scene reconstruction mesh so the path correctly disappears behind pillars, furniture, and walls instead of floating on top of everything.\n\nRoute data comes from a lightweight indoor map format; the app snaps the user's ARKit world position to the nearest map node every few frames to keep the path aligned as they walk.",
