      "id": "pulse-haptics-sdk",
      "title": "Pulse Haptics SDK",
      "platform": "Tools",
      "summary": "A cross-platform haptic abstraction layer that maps one authoring format to Quest, PC VR controllers, and Vision Pro's limited feedback channels.",
      "longDescription": "Pulse lets a developer author one haptic \"cue\" \u2014 amplitude and frequency curves over time \u2014 and have it translated automatically to whatever the target device actually supports, from full waveform playback down to a single on/off pulse.\n\nThe SDK ships as a Unity plugin plus a small native layer per platform, so the authoring format stays identical across every supported headset and controller.",
